' Evaluation scopes after the legacy phlo meter is retired (DR-66, decision D3).
' Each kind of evaluation maps to exactly one accounting scope. No scope uses the
' legacy meter; historical body-only execution returns a compatibility error.
'
' Source of truth: docs/casper/theory/cost-accounting-decision-records.md (DR-66, DR-71).
' Palette:  requests = supply blue · native metered scopes = pool green
'           unmetered trusted scopes = capability indigo · unchanged system scope = gate teal
'           rejected scope = red · notes = grey
' Render:  plantuml -tsvg docs/casper/theory/diagrams/offered-evaluation-scopes.puml
'          (or: ./render.sh offered-evaluation-scopes.puml)

@startuml offered-evaluation-scopes
!include palette.iuml
$ca_base_skin()
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #333333
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor $ca_neutral
left to right direction
title Evaluation scopes without the legacy meter (DR-66)

rectangle "**Historical body-only**\nlegacy deploy body" as LegacyReq $ca_supply
rectangle "**Genesis replay**\nvalidator replay of genesis" as GenesisReplayReq $ca_supply
rectangle "**RhoSpec harness**\ngenesis contract tests" as SpecReq $ca_supply
rectangle "**Internal read**\npolicy and token metadata" as ReadReq $ca_supply
rectangle "**Exploratory estimate**\nclient phloLimit choice" as EstimateReq $ca_supply
rectangle "**System deploy**\nclose block, slash, epoch" as SystemReq $ca_supply
rectangle "**Genesis**\napproved genesis terms" as GenesisReq $ca_supply
rectangle "**User deploy**\noffered-funded envelope" as UserReq $ca_supply

rectangle "compatibility error\nbefore any state reset" as Incompatible $ca_rejectfill
rectangle "trusted install replay\nsymmetric with genesis play" as TrustedReplay $ca_capability
rectangle "inj path\nnamed RhoSpec scope" as InjPath $ca_capability
rectangle "unmetered internal read\ndeterministic" as InternalRead $ca_capability
rectangle "native dry run\nunfunded · host-work bounded\nreset to start root · returns measured phlo" as DryRun $ca_pool
rectangle "system scope\nunchanged" as SystemScope $ca_gate
rectangle "trusted install\nunmetered · Unit signature · cost 0" as TrustedInstall $ca_capability
rectangle "native offered meter\nfunded · settled · receipts" as NativeFunded $ca_pool

LegacyReq -[$ca_debit]-> Incompatible
GenesisReplayReq --> TrustedReplay
SpecReq --> InjPath
ReadReq --> InternalRead
EstimateReq --> DryRun
SystemReq --> SystemScope
GenesisReq --> TrustedInstall
UserReq --> NativeFunded

note right of Incompatible $ca_note_grey
  The legacy meter adapter is commented
  out with the reason "D3: legacy phlo
  meter retired". A fresh protocol-6
  genesis is required.
end note

legend bottom
  |= colour |= meaning |
  |<$ca_supply>| kind of evaluation request |
  |<$ca_pool>| native meter (funded, or unfunded dry run) |
  |<$ca_capability>| trusted or internal unmetered scope |
  |<$ca_gate>| unchanged system scope |
  |<$ca_rejectfill>| rejected request |
endlegend

@enduml
